            <ArticleTitle>Sodium bicarbonate solution nebulization in the treatment of acute severe asthma.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>325-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This is a case report of a 15-year-old asthmatic girl who was admitted with a severe acute attack of bronchial asthma who eventually recovered, possibly with the help of sodium bicarbonate solution nebulization.</AbstractText>
